WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.880
Movies?

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.680
Movies mean storytelling.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.720
Movies mean family.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.350
Really, three things-- to
escape, to entertain, and to

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.010
challenge.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.320
[SPEAKING SPANISH]

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.090
Visuality.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.640
Movies are literally
everything to me.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.840
They're my happy place.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.760
They're my life and
they're my soul.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.710
Movies for me are
like a religion.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.960
And movie theaters
are like a church.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.670
It's sacred.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.920
It's the only place
that you would willingly

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.960
go into a large
darkened room and know

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.780
that you're going to come out of
there transformed in some way.

